  "description": "This is a lightweight, high-performance 2D game engine built using SFML.NET, inspired by MonoGame. The engine provides a simple yet flexible framework for creating 2D games, leveraging the power of SFML for rendering, input handling, audio, and more. Whether you're a hobbyist or a seasoned game developer, this engine offers the tools you need to create your next 2D project with ease.",
